[1.853783, "o", "Vera Example — deterministic first-mirror demo\r\ncorpus=0.5.0 schema=12 envelope=2\r\nmode=no-cost offline canned responses; network/provider calls=0\r\nworkspace=demo/workspace (external temporary workspace; display alias only)\r\npaths=stored locators are canonical real paths; this checkout root displays as . (display alias only)\r\n\r\n== Setup and invented Vera corpus capture ==\r\n\r\n$ exp2res init\r\nInitialized schema version 12 at demo/workspace.\r\n\r\nConfigured demo/workspace timezone: Europe/Berlin\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace log today --project 'K8s Playbook' --file examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-06-02.md\r\nCreated raw log log_demo_0001 with evidence evi_demo_0001.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace log today --project 'K8s Playbook' --file examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-06-25.md\r\nCreated raw log log_demo_0002 with evidence evi_demo_0002.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace log today --project 'K8s Playbook' --file examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-07-02.md\r\nCreated raw log log_demo_0003 with evidence evi_demo_0003.\r\n\r\n== Facts, gaps, and contradictions from the captured logs ==\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace extract\r\nExtracted 3 facts (0 superseded).\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace detections generate\r\nReplaced the complete gap and contradiction sets. Current gaps (1): gap_demo_0001. Current contradictions (1): contradiction_demo_0001. Invalidated artifact classes: none.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace gaps list\r\ngap_demo_0001\tmedium\tmissing_metric\tfalse\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace contradictions show --contradiction-id contradiction_demo_0001\r\ncontradiction_demo_0001\tVera Example ingress completion conflict\t2026-07-11T10:05:00+02:00\r\n\r\n== Act 1 — rejected overclaim and first-class export refusal ==\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess generate\r\nCreated snapshot_demo_0001 — Self-Assessment — Global; 2 claims.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess show --snapshot snapshot_demo_0001\r\nSelf-Assessment — Global\r\nclaim_demo_0001\tpattern_signal\ttechnical_skill\tmedium\tunverified\r\nclaim_demo_0002\tnarrative_summary\ttrajectory\tmedium\tunverified\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess verify --snapshot snapshot_demo_0001\r\nAssessment verification completed, but assessment export is blocked.\r\nSnapshot snapshot_demo_0001: rejected\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0001\r\nTarget claim: claim_demo_0001\r\nStatus: rejected\r\nReason: The Vera Example corpus contains no production-tenure or seniority evidence.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- operated production Kubernetes systems for ten years\r\nSuggested rewrite: Vera Example drafted and validated a kubectl troubleshooting runbook on an invented toy cluster.\r\nCounterevidence:\r\n- Vera Example only walked steps on an invented toy cluster. [experience_fact:fact_demo_0001]\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0002\r\nTarget claim: claim_demo_0002\r\nStatus: supported\r\nReason: The narrower Vera Example evidence-bound summary is supported.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- none\r\nCounterevidence:\r\n- none\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace export assessment --snapshot snapshot_demo_0001\r\nAssessment export is blocked by its verification-status gate.\r\n\r\nAct 1 result: verifier exit 10; assessment export exit 10; no blocked export published.\r\n\r\n== Act 2 — supported mirror and its published export ==\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess generate\r\nCreated snapshot_demo_0002 — Self-Assessment — Global; 2 claims; superseded snapshot_demo_0001.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess verify --snapshot snapshot_demo_0002\r\nSnapshot snapshot_demo_0002: supported\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0003\r\nTarget claim: claim_demo_0003\r\nStatus: supported\r\nReason: The Vera Example claim resolves to the supplied fact, evidence-item, and raw-log closure.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- none\r\nCounterevidence:\r\n- none\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0004\r\nTarget claim: claim_demo_0004\r\nStatus: supported\r\nReason: The Vera Example claim resolves to the supplied fact, evidence-item, and raw-log closure.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- none\r\nCounterevidence:\r\n- none\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace assess show --snapshot snapshot_demo_0002\r\nSelf-Assessment — Global\r\nclaim_demo_0003\tpattern_signal\tworking_style\tmedium\tsupported\r\nclaim_demo_0004\tnarrative_summary\ttrajectory\tmedium\tsupported\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace export assessment --snapshot snapshot_demo_0002\r\ndemo/workspace/out/assessment/snapshot_demo_0002/manifest.json\r\ndemo/workspace/out/assessment/snapshot_demo_0002/evidence_map.json\r\ndemo/workspace/out/assessment/snapshot_demo_0002/report.html\r\ndemo/workspace/out/assessment/snapshot_demo_0002/report.md\r\ndemo/workspace/out/assessment/snapshot_demo_0002/self_claims.json\r\n\r\nClaim claim_demo_0003 -> fact fact_demo_0001 -> evidence evi_demo_0001 -> raw log log_demo_0001\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace logs show --log-id log_demo_0001\r\n{\r\n  \"log\": {\r\n    \"id\": \"log_demo_0001\",\r\n    \"recorded_at\": \"2026-06-02T21:00:00+02:00\",\r\n    \"entry_type\": \"manual_daily\",\r\n    \"source_type\": \"manual_entry\",\r\n    \"occurred\": {\r\n      \"start\": \"2026-06-02T00:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"end\": null,\r\n      \"precision\": \"exact_day\",\r\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"project\": \"K8s Playbook\",\r\n    \"corrects_log_id\": null,\r\n    \"external_ref\": \"./examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-06-02.md\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"evidence_items\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"evi_demo_0001\",\r\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-06-02T21:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"raw_log_id\": \"log_demo_0001\",\r\n      \"title\": null,\r\n      \"summary\": \"Owner-authored manual claim.\",\r\n      \"uri\": null,\r\n      \"path\": null,\r\n      \"strength\": \"manual_claim\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[1.853928, "o", "# Daily log — 2026-06-02 — Vera Example\r\n\r\nDrafted the kubectl troubleshooting runbook for the K8s Playbook.\r\nWalked every step on the toy three-node cluster before writing it down.\r\nThe crashloopbackoff section still needs a real example.\r\n\r\nContradiction contradiction_demo_0001 -> raw logs log_demo_0002 and log_demo_0003\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace logs show --log-id log_demo_0002\r\n{\r\n  \"log\": {\r\n    \"id\": \"log_demo_0002\",\r\n    \"recorded_at\": \"2026-06-25T22:00:00+02:00\",\r\n    \"entry_type\": \"manual_daily\",\r\n    \"source_type\": \"manual_entry\",\r\n    \"occurred\": {\r\n      \"start\": \"2026-06-25T00:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"end\": null,\r\n      \"precision\": \"exact_day\",\r\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"project\": \"K8s Playbook\",\r\n    \"corrects_log_id\": null,\r\n    \"external_ref\": \"./examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-06-25.md\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"evidence_items\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"evi_demo_0002\",\r\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-06-25T22:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"raw_log_id\": \"log_demo_0002\",\r\n      \"title\": null,\r\n      \"summary\": \"Owner-authored manual claim.\",\r\n      \"uri\": null,\r\n      \"path\": null,\r\n      \"strength\": \"manual_claim\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n# Daily log — 2026-06-25 — Vera Example\r\n\r\nFinished the ingress guide today. Merged the last section and closed my\r\nchecklist item. Feels done.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace logs show --log-id log_demo_0003\r\n{\r\n  \"log\": {\r\n    \"id\": \"log_demo_0003\",\r\n    \"recorded_at\": \"2026-07-02T21:00:00+02:00\",\r\n    \"entry_type\": \"manual_daily\",\r\n    \"source_type\": \"manual_entry\",\r\n    \"occurred\": {\r\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-02T00:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"end\": null,\r\n      \"precision\": \"exact_day\",\r\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"project\": \"K8s Playbook\",\r\n    \"corrects_log_id\": null,\r\n    \"external_ref\": \"./examples/vera/corpus/logs/daily-2026-07-02.md\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"evidence_items\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"evi_demo_0003\",\r\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-02T21:00:00+02:00\",\r\n      \"raw_log_id\": \"log_demo_0003\",\r\n      \"title\": null,\r\n      \"summary\": \"Owner-authored manual claim.\",\r\n      \"uri\": null,\r\n      \"path\": null,\r\n      \"strength\": \"manual_claim\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n# Daily log — 2026-07-02 — Vera Example\r\n\r\nOpened the ingress guide to add a link and found half the TLS section is\r\nstill placeholder text. It was not actually finished. Picked the\r\ndrafting back up today.\r\n\r\n== Act 3 — job-targeted verified bullet pack ==\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace jd add examples/vera/corpus/jds/jd-docs-engineer-examplia.md\r\nAdded job description jd_demo_0001 with 6 typed requirements.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace jd list\r\njd_demo_0001\t2026-07-12T10:00:00+02:00\tTechnical Writer, Platform Documentation\tExamplia GmbH\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace bullets generate --jd jd_demo_0001 --snapshot snapshot_demo_0002 --branch docs-examplia\r\nCreated branch_demo_0001 — docs-examplia; 2 bullets.\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace bullets verify --branch docs-examplia\r\nBranch branch_demo_0001 — docs-examplia: 2 of 2 bullets supported.\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0005\r\nTarget bullet: bullet_demo_0001\r\nStatus: supported\r\nReason: Every material assertion resolves to the supplied fact, evidence-item, and raw-log closure.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- none\r\n\r\nFinding finding_demo_0006\r\nTarget bullet: bullet_demo_0002\r\nStatus: supported\r\nReason: The correction record carries the reopened guide and the resumed draft.\r\nUnsupported phrases:\r\n- none\r\n\r\n$ exp2res --workspace demo/workspace bullets export --branch docs-examplia\r\ndemo/workspace/out/branch/branch_demo_0001/manifest.json\r\ndemo/workspace/out/branch/branch_demo_0001/bullet_pack.md\r\ndemo/workspace/out/branch/branch_demo_0001/evidence_map.json\r\ndemo/workspace/out/branch/branch_demo_0001/verification_report.json\r\n\r\nAct 3 result: two supported bullets published under out/branch/branch_demo_0001; 4 demands stay unmatched because the invented corpus reaches none of them:\r\n  - Comfortable working in Git: branches, pull requests, reviews.\r\n  - Python scripting for documentation tooling (link checkers, linters).\r\n  - Ex"]
